      "source": "Obtains the domain type information from the given method parameter. Will favor an explicitly registered on through\n<a href=\"../../querydsl/binding/QuerydslPredicate.html#root()\"><code>QuerydslPredicate.root()</code></a> but use the actual type of the method's return type as fallback.",
      "translation": "从给定的方法参数获取域类型信息。将优先通过 <a href=\"../../querydsl/binding/QuerydslPredicate.html#root()\"><code>QuerydslPredicate.root()</code></a> 显式注册的内容，但会使用方法返回类型的实际类型作为后备选项。",
      "count": 2
    },
